// The words of the animated "AI version" (concept A: one customer, start to finish),
// in eleven languages. site/concepts/a.html is the page; every element there with
// data-t="key" gets its words from here at build time (scripts/site-concepts.ts),
// so each language's page is complete before any script runs.
//
// Words the app or the main site already carry (health bands, "Why?", next steps,
// the meeting, the sprint, dates and points) are not repeated here: deriveA() takes
// them from the same place the product and the classic site do. ALIAS_A maps the
// page's repeated elements onto one key, so a phrase is written once.
